    {
      "title": "Israeli soldiers raze neighbourhood in Hebron, driving families from homes",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/24/israel-soldiers-raze-west-bank-neighbourhood-hebron-families-from-homes",
      "description": "<p>PM Benjamin Netanyahu vows ‘to destroy this place’ in retaliation for militant attack on army checkpoint</p><p>Israeli troops have levelled a neighbourhood in Hebron, driving out hundreds of families in <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/23/netanyahu-orders-very-extensive-operation-west-bank-two-israeli-soldiers-killed\">collective punishment for a militant attack</a> on an army checkpoint outside the West Bank city, local Palestinian authorities said.</p><p>The Hebron municipality estimated that 35 hectares (86 acres) had been destroyed or marked for destruction and about 1,500 people had been evicted from their homes by Saturday afternoon in the district of Ein Deir Baha. The whole city of 250,000 people was sealed off by checkpoints on every point of entry.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/24/israel-soldiers-raze-west-bank-neighbourhood-hebron-families-from-homes\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-10-24T13:17:13"
    },
    {
      "title": "Israel launches collective punishment campaign in Hebron after two soldiers killed",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/23/netanyahu-orders-very-extensive-operation-west-bank-two-israeli-soldiers-killed",
      "description": "<p>Benjamin Netanyahu and ministers promise demolitions and forced displacement after deadly gunfight</p><p>Israel has launched a campaign of collective punishment against Palestinians in Hebron after gunmen killed two Israeli soldiers and injured three near a checkpoint outside the city.</p><p>Benjamin Netanyahu announced a siege on Hebron and neighbouring Halhul and said residents of the gunmen’s home neighbourhoods would all be forced out. He promised mass demolitions of homes.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/23/netanyahu-orders-very-extensive-operation-west-bank-two-israeli-soldiers-killed\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-10-23T17:22:11"
    },
    {
